From 22d4be75db50440c800a9e28d56bec3f0cfa2834 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 15:39:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 025/115] ASoC: codecs: add TI TAS2557 smart amplifier driver

Adds a codec driver for the Texas Instruments TAS2557 mono/dual-mono
smart amplifier, used for the speaker path on the Google Pixel 2 XL
(taimen). The part needs a firmware image for its PLL setup and DSP
program; it stays mute without one.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
---
